            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JOSIE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a very mellow and slightly sweet dessert. I did add more extract than what the recipe called for...simply because I am partial to almond, and next time will probably up the sugar to 2 cups. I didn't add the other fruit like instructed, we just enjoyed the \"ice\". Very similar to jello, but the taste can be altered to your liking. Hubby really enjoyed this and is a good snack for the kids. Thanks Sadie."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
