            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jim Tully"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good stuff--light and tasty. Bit of sugar or whipped cream and it passes as a fine dessert.",
            "datePublished": "2019-08-13T01:01:30.040Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KitchenWitch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm giving this 4 stars because it has potential! I hated the cantaloupe... but my dad loved it. I really liked the strawberries and grapes with the almond gelatin. I agree that it may need more almond extract, maybe another teaspoon. This recipe will use up your almond extract quick, so be wary, that stuff's expensive! Otherwise, very pretty and easily adjusted if desired. Great for summer :)",
            "datePublished": "2009-08-30T16:56:12.527Z"
          },
